native page is a self-contained destination, so — mirroring the web parent and the sibling ConditionBuilder /
PresetGallery page wrappers — the page ViewModel binds the SAME fleet-sessions feed the web parent supplies through
the feature view's ChargingSessionsSource seam (ChargingStoreSessionsSource over the shared S8 ChargingStore →
