BaseFeedViewModel.asUiState helper (the standard A7 page-VM job). The empty gate is the feature view's own
TeslaChargingSessionsMapProjection.hasAnyRenderableLocation (no session, or none with a finite coordinate → empty),
so the page state holder and the rendered markers never disagree. No HTTP, no business logic, no re-implementation of
the sessions fetch/decode/projection is added by this layer. The page VM binding mirrors the fully-tested fv VM
(TeslaChargingSessionsMapViewModel) over the same seam, so it adds no new untested logic.

